- Unauthenticated deployed `GET /healthz` returned `401` after hardening, so a missing `ACCESS_TOKEN` no longer leaves public workers open.
- `prototypes/sandbox-workflow-spike/scripts/wrangler-with-cloudflare-token.mjs` wraps Wrangler and leases Cloudflare credentials from agent-secrets when `CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN` / `CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID` are absent; secret names are overrideable with `CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN_SECRET_NAME` and `CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID_SECRET_NAME`.

